  "Recurring MRR entitlement (marketing packs, client voice packs, Commerce catalog + Buy now) is tracked centrally on orders.recurringCanceledAt and kept in sync from every subscription/invoice lifecycle event (created/updated/deleted, pause_collection, past_due/unpaid, payment_failed/paid) by re-proving live subscription items against create-path catalog Price ids — never by Stripe status alone, since status stays active/trialing while collection is paused. Every consumer of 'is this lead currently entitled' (create-path Buy now / catalog sync, webhook, abandoned-recovery, digest/pipeline-health, dashboard action) must share this one predicate set; a helper that accepts entitlement data as an optional argument must require it at the type level, or a future caller can silently omit it and reopen the pause-blind hole.",
